<title>USA: New York Bagel Q1 full results.</title>
<headline>New York Bagel Q1 full results.</headline>
<dateline>WICHITA, Kan. 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	  1996</p>
<p>   Sales from co-owned restaurants     $4,289,602  $2,219,415</p>
<p>   Franchise revenues			   185,047     169,310</p>
<p>     Total revenues			   4,474,649   2,388,725</p>
<p>   Costs of sales			     1,363,774     813,230</p>
<p>   Restaurant operating expenses	  2,101,073     959,684</p>
<p>   General and administrative expenses    369,768     207,325</p>
<p>   Depreciation and amortization	    279,949	70,963</p>
<p>     Total costs and expenses	     4,114,564   2,051,202</p>
<p> Other income (expense)			  60,642    (77,125)</p>
<p>     Earnings before income taxes	   420,727     260,398</p>
<p> Income tax expense			     161,681  104,159(a)</p>
<p>     Net earnings				 259,046  156,239(a)</p>
<p> Net earnings per share			    0.06     0.05(a)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding    4,667,500   3,018,538</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Pro forma to reflect income taxes.</p>
<p>Full co name is New York Bagel Enterprises Inc.</p>
<p>Periods ended March 30 vs March 31.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
